  {
   "id": "hedge factor",
   "nombre_canonico": "Hedge Factor",
   "tipo": "concepto",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "Hedge Factor"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    358
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Factor sintético que impulsa el precio en el modelo HFT; el precio accionario de alta frecuencia es función de la exposición a este factor y su volatilidad, sin basarse en fundamentales.",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "We present a simple closed form stock price formula, which captures empirical regularities of high frequency trading (HFT), based on two factors: (1) exposure to hedge factor; and (2) hedge factor volatility.",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "PREDICE",
     "tipo_original": "PREDICE",
     "objeto_texto": "HFT Stock Price",
     "doc_id": 358,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "phase locked trading",
   "nombre_canonico": "Phase Locked Trading",
   "tipo": "fenomeno",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "Phase Locked Trading"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    358
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Situación donde un número suficientemente grande de traders ejecuta estrategias idénticas simultáneamente (phase-locked), magnificando exponencialmente el efecto de precio y causando crashes o bubbles.",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "When such strategies are phased locked for a sufficient large number of traders, a relatively small short selling trade strategy is magnified exponentially, and the stock price plummets.",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "CAUSA",
     "tipo_original": "CAUSA",
     "objeto_texto": "Market Crash",
     "doc_id": 358,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "CAUSA",
     "tipo_original": "CAUSA",
     "objeto_texto": "Price Bubble",
     "doc_id": 358,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "van der corput s lemma",
   "nombre_canonico": "van der Corput's Lemma",
   "tipo": "metodo",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "van der Corput's Lemma"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    358
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Lema de análisis matemático para integrales oscilatorias; cuando estrategias phase-locked violan sus prerrequisitos, las ganancias de capital están acotadas inferiormente (crash) pero no superiormente (bubble).",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "Capital gains from trading is bounded from below (crash), i.e. flight to quality, but not from above (bubble), i.e. confidence, when phased locked trade strategies violate prerequisites of van der Corput's Lemma for oscillatory integrals.",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "APLICA_A",
     "tipo_original": "APLICA_A",
     "objeto_texto": "HFT Stock Price",
     "doc_id": 358,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "PREDICE",
     "tipo_original": "PREDICE",
     "objeto_texto": "Market Crash",
     "doc_id": 358,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "double exponential representation",
   "nombre_canonico": "Double Exponential Representation",
   "tipo": "metodo",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "Double Exponential Representation"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    358
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Representación cerrada del precio HFT como doble exponencial cuando la volatilidad del hedge factor se especifica adecuadamente.",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "For given exposure to hedge factor, and suitable specification of hedge factor volatility, HFT stock price has a closed form double exponential representation.",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "APLICA_A",
     "tipo_original": "APLICA_A",
     "objeto_texto": "HFT Stock Price",
     "doc_id": 358,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "egarch volatility",
   "nombre_canonico": "EGARCH Volatility",
   "tipo": "metodo",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "EGARCH Volatility"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    358
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Proceso de volatilidad tipo EGARCH endógeno que incorpora respuesta asimétrica a noticias; los retornos intradía heredan un patrón en forma de U de las estrategias HFT.",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "We demonstrate how asymmetric response to news is incorporated in the stock price by and through an endogenous EGARCH type volatility process for past returns; and find that intraday returns have a U-shaped pattern inherited from HFT strategies.",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "HFT Stock Price",
     "doc_id": 358,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cost of carry model",
   "nombre_canonico": "Cost of Carry Model",
   "tipo": "concepto",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "Cost of Carry Model"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    358
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Modelo de costo de acarreo usado junto con la fórmula de precio HFT para estimar ratios de cobertura dinámicos y ganancias de capital mark-to-market en contratos E-mini.",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "In tandem with a cost of carry model, it allows us to use exposure to and volatility of E-mini contracts to estimate dynamic hedge ratios, and mark-to-market capital gains on contracts.",
     "doc_id": 358
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "Hedge Factor",
     "doc_id": 358,
